<footer class="border-t border-sand-200/60 dark:border-sand-800/60 bg-sand-50 dark:bg-sand-900">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-10">
      <!-- Brand -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-400 to-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="text-white font-bold text-xs">V</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-sand-900 dark:text-white">Vitto</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-sand-500 dark:text-sand-400 leading-relaxed">
          Shipping fast Jamstack sites shouldn't be complicated. You already use Vite, Vitto is the
          missing piece. This site proudly made with Vitto.
        </p>
